<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002S_S000E" variety="S000E">
<name>Vehicle Surroundings Monitor</name>
<ttl id="1002S_S000E_742B9_T003J" variety="T003J">
<name>Intelligent Parking Assist System</name>
<para id="RM000000O1I009X" category="C" type-id="80393" name-id="672E4-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<dtccode>C1625</dtccode>
<dtcname>Steering Angle Sensor +B Open Circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000O1I009X_09" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007N000000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This DTC is output when the television camera controller determines that the steering sensor, connected via CAN communication, is malfunctioning.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1625</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Steering Angle Sensor +B Open Circuit</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Steering Sensor</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Steering sensor power source system wire harness and connector</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000O1I009X_10" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007N100000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E144416J01" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000O1I009X_11" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00007N200000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the battery terminal is disconnected, perform the setting operations required when the battery terminal is removed and installed. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001LYW00PX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Depending on the parts replaced or the work performed during inspection, registration settings for other systems may be necessary in addition to the intelligent parking assist system. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000304S000X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000O1I009X_12" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000O1I009X_12_0017" proc-id="RM0550J___00007N300000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the DTCs by following the screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OCQ007X"/>)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" on the screen to clear the data. </ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Start the engine, check the DTCs again, and proceed to the following destination.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>"C1625" is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No DTC Output (Normal)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000O1I009X_12_0018" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000O1I009X_12_0020" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000O1I009X_12_0018" proc-id="RM0550J___00007N400000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Steering Sensor Power Source System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141969J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), with the vehicle side wire harness connector shown in the illustration disconnected, measure the resistance between each terminal from the back of the connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.45in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1 (ESS) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Voltage Inspection  </ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141969J02" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), with the vehicle side wire harness connector disconnected, measure the voltage between each terminal from the back of the connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.45in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>4(IG) - 1(ESS)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>5(BAT) - 1(ESS)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000O1I009X_12_0019" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000O1I009X_12_0021" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000O1I009X_12_0019">
<testtitle>Replace Steering Sensor<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QFH008X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
